#: ui/pages/dashboard/about/AboutPage.tsx:533
msgid "PeakURL is built to stay understandable in day-to-day use, dependable under load, and open for long-term ownership."
msgstr "PeakURL er konstruert for å være lettfattelig i daglig drift, pålitelig under stor belastning og tilrettelagt for langsiktig eierskap."

