msgid "PeakURL is released under the MIT License so anyone can adopt, study, adapt, and distribute it freely."
msgstr "PeakURL leveres under MIT-lisensen slik at enhver fritt kan ta den i bruk, analysere, tilpasse og distribuere videre."

